1165.description:
Dungelot Shattered Lands is a sequel to the cult adventure game that once captivated a wide audience and now aims to do so again. The game is being developed by just two talented individuals, full of new ideas, and ready to unveil their new project in the summer of 2016. The developers promise to improve every aspect of the game, give the player freedom, and expand the range of gameplay elements.

Dungelot Shattered Lands is an adventure role-playing game with a main character development system and an engaging combat system, presented in a "minesweeper" format. You enter a level, a hidden field opens before you, and you must open it cell by cell to reveal what's hidden behind it. This way, you can find treasures, battle enemies, and discover new paths. This time, the game is much larger, more colorful, and features powerful monsters that will be challenging to combat. The developers have also added "neutral" areas where you can talk to other characters, take on quests, and sell accumulated "junk." Despite the game's simplicity, it boasts a deep storyline, an unforgettable atmosphere, and simply enjoyable gameplay.

Game features:
- the virtual world is divided into three huge acts, with their own unique dungeons and monsters;
- 18 different dungeons with varying levels of difficulty are available;
- improved combat system;
- subtle calculation of damage and exploitation of enemy weaknesses;
- three save slots;
- many additional quests and random events;
- the presence of neutral territories;
- there is a system of theft;
- availability of mini-games;
- three strongest bosses;
- new heroes appeared.

1682.description:
If you remember the controversial company S2 Games and haven't fallen into a depressive mood over the release of their latest games, we're thrilled to share the exciting news that the company has decided to release a new installment of their most ambitious game project, Savage. They've already released the first two installments, and now it's time for new horizons, so the team has prepared a game for all fans called Savage Resurrection.

First information regarding the new part of the game:
- this is the third part of the game series, which will be connected with this virtual world;
- the new part has moved to a new game engine called Unreal Engine;
- the game is planned to be released on Steam and will have VAC anti-cheat;
- servers will accommodate up to 32 players;
- the game has been in development for a long time and is ready for release.

As before, players will be divided into monsters and hunters to engage in intense PvP combat. You'll need to dive into this chaos and strive to emerge victorious. To begin your adventure, simply download Savage Resurrection via torrent for free.

